description: Summary of key Prisma models and relationships observed in app/prisma/schema.prisma
---

# Data model

Core entities
- User: identity and auth; email/password encrypted; role (USER/ADMIN); country/timezone fields; jwtKey
- Account: logical workspace for budgets, registers, categories, etc.
- Budget: scoped under Account; links to registers, goals, notifications, bills, reconciliation
- AccountRegister: an account/register ledger row with many financial attributes
  - Types via AccountType (credit/loan flags, accrual behavior, registerClass)
  - Balance, limits, APRs, loan parameters, sort orders, min balances
  - Optional Plaid linkage (ids and access token encrypted + hashed)
  - Optional vehicle/asset depreciation fields; crypto wallet address (encrypted)
  - Relationships: entries, reoccurrences, splits, bill profiles/instances, snapshots, savingsGoals, collateral relations, child registers, categories for default payment/interest
- RegisterEntry: a ledger entry for a register
  - amount, balance, createdAt, typeId (RegisterEntryType), flags (projected, reconciled, pending, cleared, matched, balance-entry, manual)
  - Plaid linkage (encrypted ids + JSON)
  - categoryId optional, memo optional; referenceId/checkNo optional; seq ordering

Recurrences and splits
- Reoccurrence: describes a recurring transaction
  - schedule via Interval (with intervalCount), weekend adjustment, optional transfer target register
  - amount and encrypted description, optional category
  - amount adjustment mode (PERCENT/FIXED/NONE) with interval-based adjustments
  - links: entries, skips, splits, plaidNameAliases, bill profile/instances
- ReoccurrenceSplit: per-occurrence split to target another register with fixed/percent amount, optional category
- ReoccurrenceSkip: skips a specific instance
- ReoccurrencePlaidNameAlias: normalized Plaid description matching per register

Bills
- BillProfile: metadata around a reoccurrence (kind BILL/INCOME/TRANSFER, payee, autopay, expected ranges, reminder settings)
- BillInstance: concrete due item with amount, status (UPCOMING → PAID flow), paid linkage to a RegisterEntry

Reconciliation
- ReconciliationPeriod: status (OPEN/CLOSED), statement window and balances, closing metadata (closing adjustment entry), closedByUser
- ReconciliationItem: per-entry clearance tracking within a period

Snapshots and summaries
- AccountSnapshot: periodic snapshot per account
- AccountRegisterSnapshot and RegisterEntrySnapshot: captured values (balances, entries) at snapshot time
- AccountRegisterSummary: month/year balance rollup per register (UUID id)

Notifications
- NotificationEvent: active/resolved notification items with dedupe keys and payloads
- NotificationDismissal: user-initiated dismissal records

Categories
- Category: hierarchical (parent/children), account-scoped; referenced by entries, reoccurrences, splits, default register categories; note functional unique index via migration

Integrations and logging
- PlaidItem: user-level item linkage
- PlaidSyncCursor: per-item cursor for incremental sync
- PlaidSyncLog: per-sync summary (counts, status, errors)
- IntegrationAlert, IntegrationJobLog: generic external integration health
- OpenAiRequestLog: request/response metrics for OpenAI usage

Security and keys
- Rsa: key pairs (isDefault, archived flags)

Cash and crypto
- CashOnHand: denomination counts per register (ones to hundreds)
- EvmChain: chain catalog; CryptoRegisterChain links registers to chains
- CryptoTokenBalance: per-register token holdings with balance/price/value and metadata

Indices and constraints (selected)
- Many composite indices for performance and uniqueness (e.g., NotificationEvent, BillInstance, ReconciliationItem, ReoccurrencePlaidNameAlias)
- Decimal precision for monetary values (commonly Decimal(19,2); price with more precision)
- Field encryption markers on sensitive strings (/// @encrypted) and corresponding hash annotations where needed
